          "outlet": "Channel News Asia",
          "url": "https://www.channelnewsasia.com/world/trump-diesel-export-ban-europe-6428441",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "G7 member countries agreed in a joint statement to refrain from imposing energy export restrictions on one another.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "BBC World",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/ck87zg8jnwngo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "French President Emmanuel Macron stated the G7 agreed to release reserves of 'up to 100 million barrels' within four months under International Energy Agency coordination.",
          "kind": "quote",
          "outlet": "BBC World",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/ck87zg8jnwngo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "The price of global benchmark Brent crude oil briefly fell below $100 a barrel before rising back to around $102 on Friday evening.",
          "kind": "figure",
          "outlet": "BBC World",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/ck87zg8jnwngo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "Prior to the US and Israel invading Iran, Brent crude oil was trading at approximately $73 a barrel.",
          "kind": "figure",
          "outlet": "BBC World",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/ck87zg8jnwngo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "US domestic refineries produce about four to five million barrels of diesel daily, with domestic consumption at roughly 3.6 million barrels per day.",
          "kind": "figure",
          "outlet": "BBC World",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/ck87zg8jnwngo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "Russia implemented an export ban on diesel after attacks on its refineries by Ukrainian forces.",
          "kind": "background",
          "outlet": "BBC World",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/ck87zg8jnwngo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "US President Donald Trump posted on social media that Europe agreed to release a 'massive amount' of diesel from emergency stockpiles.",
          "kind": "quote",
          "outlet": "Al Jazeera",
          "url": "https://www.aljazeera.com/video/newsfeed/2026/10/2/aje-onl-nf_ig_thumb_diesel-021026?traffic_source=rss",
          "source_kind": "summary"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "Under proposals formulated by French President Emmanuel Macron, G7 members will release 50 million barrels of diesel and 50 million barrels of crude oil.",
          "kind": "figure",
          "outlet": "Guardian World",
          "url": "https://www.theguardian.com/business/2026/oct/02/g7-release-barrels-oil-diesel-reserves-emergency",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "cluster_id": 0,
