          "cluster_id": 2,
          "text": "Spain's parliament narrowly voted down two emergency government decrees intended to address rising rental housing costs.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "DW World",
          "url": "https://www.dw.com/en/spain-s-parliament-rejects-housing-bill-as-protests-continue/a-79522683?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-rdf",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "cluster_id": 2,
          "text": "The first emergency housing decree was rejected by a vote of 178 to 172 in the Chamber of Deputies.",
          "kind": "figure",
          "outlet": "DW World",
          "url": "https://www.dw.com/en/spain-s-parliament-rejects-housing-bill-as-protests-continue/a-79522683?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-rdf",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "cluster_id": 2,
          "text": "The second emergency decree failed in Spain's parliament by a vote of 184 to 166.",
          "kind": "figure",
          "outlet": "DW World",
          "url": "https://www.dw.com/en/spain-s-parliament-rejects-housing-bill-as-protests-continue/a-79522683?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-rdf",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "cluster_id": 2,
          "text": "Protests across Spain were triggered by the eviction of 87-year-old Madrid resident Maricarmen Abascal from her apartment.",
          "kind": "background",
          "outlet": "DW World",
          "url": "https://www.dw.com/en/spain-s-parliament-rejects-housing-bill-as-protests-continue/a-79522683?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-rdf",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "cluster_id": 2,
          "text": "Housing rents in Spain have approximately doubled over the past decade.",
          "kind": "figure",
          "outlet": "DW World",
          "url": "https://www.dw.com/en/spain-s-parliament-rejects-housing-bill-as-protests-continue/a-79522683?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-rdf",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "cluster_id": 2,
          "text": "The conservative People's Party, far-right Vox, and Catalan pro-independence party Junts joined together to vote against both housing decrees.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "Guardian World",
          "url": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/oct/02/spanish-right-wing-votes-down-housing-crisis-plans-protest-movement-grows",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "cluster_id": 2,
          "text": "According to the Youth Council of Spain, average rent in Spain rose to €1,176 per month, representing 98.7% of the average salary for under-30s.",
          "kind": "figure",
          "outlet": "Guardian World",
          "url": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/oct/02/spanish-right-wing-votes-down-housing-crisis-plans-protest-movement-grows",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "cluster_id": 2,
          "text": "A protest encampment in Madrid's Puerta del Sol plaza expanded to include more than 1,200 tents.",
          "kind": "figure",
          "outlet": "Guardian World",
          "url": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/oct/02/spanish-right-wing-votes-down-housing-crisis-plans-protest-movement-grows",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "cluster_id": 2,
          "text": "The Spanish Tenants' Union (Sindicato de Inquilinas) announced it was ending its tent protest in central Madrid to focus organization efforts on local neighborhoods.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "BBC World",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c623dlk4y75mo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "cluster_id": 2,
          "text": "Maricarmen Abascal was evicted after being unable to pay a rent increase imposed by real estate company Urbagestión.",
          "kind": "background",
          "outlet": "BBC World",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c623dlk4y75mo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "cluster_id": 2,
          "text": "Maricarmen Abascal was evicted on September 23 from her Madrid apartment, where she had lived for about seven decades.",
          "kind": "background",
          "outlet": "France 24",
          "url": "https://www.france24.com/en/europe/20261002-spanish-lawmakers-vote-down-affordable-housing-bills-in-blow-to-sanchez-s-government",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        }
      ]
    },
